# Local

Import Conventions from "./conventions.lg".
Import HostFiles from "./host_files.lg".
Import NodeRecord from "./node_record.lg".
Import VerdictRecord from "./verdict_record.lg".
Import TrailRecord from "./trail_record.lg".
Import AttemptRecord from "./attempt_record.lg".
Import ChatRequest from "./chat_request.lg".
Import ChatReply from "./chat_reply.lg".
Import Budget from "./budget.lg".
Import Cost from "./cost.lg".
Import Replay from "./replay.lg".
Import LocalSettings from "./local_settings.lg".
Import LocalStore from "./local_store.lg".
Import LocalPlan from "./local_plan.lg".
Import LocalAttempt from "./local_attempt.lg".

The whole loop on one machine against one problem: read its trail, build the
prompt its next unit needs, ask the model (a recording, a mock or OpenRouter),
take the one submission out of the answer, judge it with the real kernel, and
write down what happened. It is the worker's loop with the coordinator replaced
by a workspace directory, so the loop runs before any service exists.

## An AttemptOutcome has:
    a verdict, which is Text.
    a proceed, which is Bool.
    a line, which is Text.

## To stopped (line: Text, verdict: Text) -> AttemptOutcome:
    Return a new AttemptOutcome with verdict verdict and proceed false and line line.

## Note
One attempt on `problemId`, written down whatever happens: a budget stop and a
judged answer both reach the trail; a missing recording reaches nothing.

## To runAttempt (workspace: Text, problemId: Text, s: LocalSettings, budget: Budget) -> (AttemptOutcome, Budget):
    Inspect loadStatement(workspace, problemId):
        When Err (e):
            Return (stopped(e, ""), budget).
        When Ok (statement):
            Inspect loadTrail(workspace + "/trails/" + slugOf(problemId) + ".jsonl"):
                When Err (e):
                    Return (stopped(e, ""), budget).
                When Ok (trail):
                    Let kind be nextKind(trail).
                    If kind is equal to "done":
                        Return (stopped("{problemId} is already verified", "verified"), budget).
                    Let request be planRequest(workspace, problemId, statement, trail, kind).
                    Let strategy be loadStrategy(workspace).
                    Let mutable entry be blankEntry(problemId, kind, "", "").
                    Set entry's ts to clockMs().
                    Set entry's contributor to s's contributor.
                    Set entry's model to request's model.
                    Set entry's strategyId to strategy's id.
                    Set entry's promptSha to promptSha(request).
                    Inspect priceFor(workspace, s, request's model):
                        When Err (e):
                            Return (stopped(e, ""), budget).
                        When Ok (price):
                            Let held be reservationMicros(price, request).
                            Inspect reserve(budget, held):
                                When Err (stop):
                                    Set entry's kind to "budget_stop".
                                    Set entry's diagnostics to stop.
                                    Let sealed be appendToTrail(trail, entry).
                                    Let w be appendLine(workspace + "/trails", slugOf(problemId) + ".jsonl", toJson_TrailEntry(item (length of sealed) of sealed)).
                                    Return (stopped(stop, "budget_exhausted"), budget).
                                When Ok (holding):
                                    Inspect askModel(s, request):
                                        When Err (why):
                                            Return (stopped(why, ""), settle(holding, held, 0)).
                                        When Ok (reply):
                                            Let cost be actualCostMicros(price, reply, held).
                                            Let promptArtifacts be ["prompt:" + storeArtifact(workspace, chatRequestJson(request)), "response:" + storeArtifact(workspace, reply's content)].
                                            Let j be judgeAnswer(workspace, statement, kind, strategy's id, trail, reply's content).
                                            Let sealed be appendToTrail(trail, attemptEntry(entry, j, cost, promptArtifacts)).
                                            Let last be item (length of sealed) of sealed.
                                            Let mutable a be a new Attempt with id "{slugOf(problemId)}-{last's seq}" and unitId "local" and problemId problemId and contributor s's contributor.
                                            Set a's model to reply's model.
                                            Set a's strategyId to strategy's id.
                                            Set a's promptSha to last's promptSha.
                                            Set a's responseSha to sha256Hex(reply's content).
                                            Set a's documentSha to j's documentSha.
                                            Set a's approachFingerprint to j's fingerprint.
                                            Set a's verdict to j's verdict.
                                            Set a's costMicros to cost.
                                            Set a's startedAt to entry's ts.
                                            Set a's finishedAt to clockMs().
                                            Let fault be recordAttempt(workspace, s's resultsDir, last, a, j).
                                            Let line be "{problemId} #{last's seq} {kind}: {j's verdict's kind} · cost " + formatMicros(cost) + fault.
                                            Let outcome be a new AttemptOutcome with verdict j's verdict's kind and proceed (j's verdict's kind is not equal to "verified") and line line.
                                            Return (outcome, settle(holding, held, cost)).
    Return (stopped("unreachable", ""), budget).
